  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>According to Newton Leibnitz theorem we have<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mo>d</mo><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Apply Newtons Leibnitz theorem in the given equation.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
